{"id":830,"bodyHtml":"<div><div><p><br></p><p>2025年12月15日上午11：00，中北大学材料科学与工程学院“逐梦研途，薪火相传”考研学子慰问活动在学院会议室举行。院党委书记廖海洪、院长王强、党委副书记辛振东、全体辅导员、毕业班班主任及各年级学生代表参加活动。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=on7WufnlLDL7VfLUzLaLz6kUm-sLmnnfMzvbLz98LNL4olU0gihFp2hmCIa0MYysU1yaLSyiMNLPUzMkM4NZLmLDLmUbLllanz98LlCanmQFMN74oRCPUznFL8rRU47Jv2bjo4OeoDMOqsAbQDMZ_ShXptQ0g47iMzL0Lzv8Mm9JqdSnx&oid=1073042095&tid=1553&nid=17468&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/77B0156C1A3B7982362491E0E841F0F6/6A3861A4/3ECC1\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=oMRNuDoRlYUmUaUU8WVL8CinRTVnl-nDL4v4LNW2LRC4Mz70gihFp2hmCIa0LShVoSybn1hfnmNsnmnVozvYnRnkMNQ7UN74M47PnN-8MzQFoRNYLmNPLzQFo7M2UNCJv2bjo4OeoDMOqsAbQDMZ_ShXptQ0g47iMzL0Lzv8Mm9JqdSnx&oid=1073042095&tid=1553&nid=17468&e=.png\"></p><p>活动伊始，院长王强致辞。他肯定了考研学子备考中的坚韧毅力，指出考研是磨砺意志、追逐梦想的征程，学院将始终作为每一位考研学子的坚强后盾，希望大家在冲刺阶段调整心态、放松心情、沉着应战、诚信应考。同时，寄语低年级学生以考研学子为榜样，尽早明确目标、规划路径，脚踏实地求学。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=on7luaL8-aMz98UU49YUl7aU4TRnNWnkU4CZL8nfLlL4oRU0gihFp2hmCIa0okyZokyPU1y8UzUaMNLsMz67U4v8oRNZL8C8Ll7YL4-4MlrFUNlZUNCZnNQFM778ozLJv2bjo4OeoDMOqsAbQDMZ_ShXptQ0g47iMzL0Lzv8Mm9JqdSnx&oid=1073042095&tid=1553&nid=17468&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/8881B4A406C757DC748983F41A23235E/BE8BF8FF/4A493\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=oozMu2LlliMN-YoUllPol7aollZMRQnRLRQRMmNiLl-aM4C0gihFp2hmCIa0LSyaLYysokhkolU8olCPMzQVL8LiL4-aLmVVUzTVMRA7Lm6FMR6RUzWfnzQFUm7ZUzUJv2bjo4OeoDMOqsAbQDMZ_ShXptQ0g47iMzL0Lzv8Mm9JqdSnx&oid=1073042095&tid=1553&nid=17468&e=.png\"></p><p>随后，廖海洪书记、王强院长为考研学子代表颁发亲笔签名的“致全院考研学子的一封信”。信中，既回望学子“从初秋晨读幕写到深冬挑灯夜战”的备考坚守，又以真挚文字疏导压力、梳理心态，叮嘱大家稳住节奏、劳逸结合，以从容姿态迎考，并鼓励学子无论结果如何，这段时光锤炼的意志与积累的学识，都是人生的宝贵财富，未来当坚守“致知于行”校训，深耕材料领域，为国家制造业高质量发展聚力。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=on77ubnmLDL8LiMUlC8U878L7Uaoz-niLmAVUmLZU47ZU4G0gihFp2hmCIa0Mkh7LSysLYh2Ll78ozrkM4MVLzMVM8-ZL4-8Ll7iLlrfM46FnRvaolLZo7WFo7MfMlCJv2bjo4OeoDMOqsAbQDMZ_ShXptQ0g47iMzL0Lzv8Mm9JqdSnx&oid=1073042095&tid=1553&nid=17468&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/4D173F1A495B73E13E7B83241A51EA77/D709C88B/8CA5F\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=oMmfuko7CYUlCsMU7C4LmVVnz9YM8lnPM7UiLmAfo7LiMm90gihFp2hmCIa0nkhfoSyZMYy8LlVVLzLDolQfLRUYnllbn7-iMR9Dn7QfM7nFMzvPLz74LRMFLzrRolCPgjfJQ4Oeo4xmp2xZ_I6m_dN0qIbtpYyPMzl4g47sMRCZgtA8pUScc&oid=1073042095&tid=1553&nid=17468&e=.png\"></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=oU4luYMNrRozLPLUmGPozNbozCPnz9nPnmAVLmnkLmNanll0gihFp2hmCIa0LkyYLShRMkh7Lm-iLRl4nzTfMzNDnRGZnzlPU8Cio7MVnNVFLlnkLzG4L8WFM7MRUzNJv2bjo4OeoDMOqsAbQDMZ_ShXptQ0g47iMzL0Lzv8Mm9JqdSnx&oid=1073042095&tid=1553&nid=17468&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/021C4D225053E9A596D08E51CF58CEFA/1DB1033B/4CCA9\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=onzru2M8WfMmCDMURU4LNLZoRCYUNWnfMmW2nR-boRvYM7L0gihFp2hmCIa0M1yaM1ysUSh2MRGZnNL4nRVRolLioR-ZnR9bM7l4U462nzrFUzARo7QRMlQFn778o7-Jv2bjo4OeoDMOqsAbQDMZ_ShXptQ0g47iMzL0Lzv8Mm9JqdSnx&oid=1073042095&tid=1553&nid=17468&e=.png\"></p><p>考研学子代表陈鸿山分享备考心得，感谢学院关怀支持，承诺将带着温暖与鼓励自信应考、全力以赴。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=onRWu7U4ffLzf7MUzrRMm7PUm9aMmUn4MlCbn7Q2M46RnR-0gihFp2hmCIa0okhVUSh2oSh7MmrfUz6VLmAkoRlPLzf2L4fkUz62MR9YUmWFU874MNC8nNWFM7CiUNUJv2bjo4OeoDMOqsAbQDMZ_ShXptQ0g47iMzL0Lzv8Mm9JqdSnx&oid=1073042095&tid=1553&nid=17468&e=.png\" alt=\"\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/8EAF9D65AA7E28B85110F30BA7F482B2/CA36F4FB/4F5BD\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=onzluZU4LaM7l4nUz78nRv4M7VkU47nPLR6RMzWVMzlPMR90gihFp2hmCIa0U1yiLYh2Lky4nNWVozA7nmAfnzN4U4NiUlnfL8CZLRTfLRMFUmrko7l8n7rFoz-iozLJv2bjo4OeoDMOqsAbQDMZ_ShXptQ0g47iMzL0Lzv8Mm9JqdSnx&oid=1073042095&tid=1553&nid=17468&e=.png\"></p><p>最后，廖海洪书记作总结讲话。他首先代表学院为考研学子送上了诚挚的祝福，分析了今年考研好的形势与机遇，引导学子正确看待考前冲刺的艰辛，强调越是临近终点，越要坚守初心、咬紧牙关不放弃，坚持到最后一刻。他寄语全体考研学子，要秉持“功成不必在我，功成必定有我”的信念，沉着应战、不放弃，书写佳绩。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=oL8Qu2LzVRnNQRUU8QkL8U4oR-bM7Cn4U4CbUzWVUzV2Ull0gihFp2hmCIa0MSyPnSyZL1hkLmMkM4L8MmNinRlDnmMRUz98L4rVL8lsLlQFnm-ZMlQRUNnFM7rVnllJv2bjo4OeoDMOqsAbQDMZ_ShXptQ0g47iMzL0Lzv8Mm9JqdSnx&oid=1073042095&tid=1553&nid=17468&e=.png\" alt=\"\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/51E82B23B734695D56F3CA8435E3E71F/F285FCBD/4EEEE\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=oolQu2MRN4UzUinURQRLNlYoRGiozCnZU4vbUl-4MllPn7C0gihFp2hmCIa0oSh7USysL1hRnl7iUzGPMmL4UlUYU47DU4VRolnfUmLPUzQFMz7bnRARLNMFnRLsUmvJv2bjo4OeoDMOqsAbQDMZ_ShXptQ0g47iMzL0Lzv8Mm9JqdSnx&oid=1073042095&tid=1553&nid=17468&e=.png\"></p><p>据摸排统计，全院共有326名同学投身2026年考研备考。此次发放的每一封慰问信均由廖海洪书记、王强院长亲笔签名，一笔一划间饱含着学院领导对材料学子的深切关怀与殷切期望，让这份考前慰问更具专属感与珍藏意义，也让学子们在冲刺的关键节点感受到了来自学院的温暖与力量，为他们的研途征程注入了强劲动力。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=on77uaoRW2LmUYMUR94L4GiU8UsnmLnaU8-YL8QkLRW7Lll0gihFp2hmCIa0okyYLSyaokyPMNM2LNMRLzV7ozGZnzM2Ll-DU4-sUz-DLlnFUz-ZLl-bnzMFL4CbnmCJv2bjo4OeoDMOqsAbQDMZ_ShXptQ0g47iMzL0Lzv8Mm9JqdSnx&oid=1073042095&tid=1553&nid=17468&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/8210816CF2CC11D908E3F1B6C27A261D/A281B9E3/369F6\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=oLRWu7MRGbnmCbMURUDozNZMzf2LmlnaUN7iUmNDMm-aL7L0gihFp2hmCIa0L1h7LSybMYy8nNCanR78U87anRn2ozQ7L47io7VfoR9DnzAFnmU8L7VfMzWFoR-YnRNJv2bjo4OeoDMOqsAbQDMZ_ShXptQ0g47iMzL0Lzv8Mm9JqdSnx&oid=1073042095&tid=1553&nid=17468&e=.png\"></p><p><br></p></div></div>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://3y.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=on7WufnlLDL7VfLUzLaLz6kUm-sLmnnfMzvbLz98LNL4olU0gihFp2hmCIa0MYysU1yaLSyiMNLPUzMkM4NZLmLDLmUbLllanz98LlCanmQFMN74oRCPUznFL8rRU47Jv2bjo4OeoDMOqsAbQDMZ_ShXptQ0g47iMzL0Lzv8Mm9JqdSnx&oid=1073042095&tid=1553&nid=17468&e=.png"}